# CR 117.3c-117.4, ADR-0019: a response resolves before the spell it
# answers. Both players are at 3 life. ai, the active player, casts
# Lightning Bolt at human; human responds with a Bolt of their own at ai.
# Once both pass, only the top object resolves (CR 117.4): human's Bolt
# puts ai at 0, the state-based-action check that follows ends the game
# (CR 704.5a), and ai's Bolt never resolves -- it is still on the stack.
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 4 R
tapformana human 2 R
queue targets human
queue targets ai
queue action ai cast 3
queue action human cast 1
passpriority
